Package: coiR
Type: Package
Title: Package to analyze Canopy Openness Index (COI)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Edson Nilton de Moura Silva-Júnior",
      email = "edsonbbiologia@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: That package allow to analyze canopy fisheye images, crop them into circular images, and calculate its Canopy Openness Index (COI), a widley used methodology to understand forest proprieties, as brightness and protection against solar radiation.
